/-- Pascual Jordan Homotope / Kantor Triple Product `{U, V, W} = U * V * W + W * V * U`. -/
def jordanTriple (U V W : B) : B := U * V * W + W * V * U

/-- Theorem 4.1 (`CompleteTenForgottenPhysicsArchetypesPoset` & `WheelerUltimateItFromBit`,
    Turns 0088 & 0094):
    Simultaneously verifies in any non-commutative `[Ring B]` with `P * P = P`:
